  - All endpoints except /health require x-api-key
  - Reject missing/invalid keys with 401 and standard JSON error format
- Observability:
  - Add OpenTelemetry instrumentation for HTTP + Prisma + custom spans
  - Include correlation IDs and structured JSON logs
  - Expose /metrics endpoint (Prometheus format) protected by API key
- Reliability:
  - Centralized error handler (no stack traces in responses)
  - Graceful shutdown support
- Testing:
  - Unit tests for validation + service layer
  - Integration tests for API endpoints using an in-memory or temp SQLite DB
- Docs:
  - README with setup steps, sample curl commands, environment variables
