DELIVERABLES
- A complete repo structure with:
  - src/ (routes, controllers, services, db, telemetry)
  - prisma/ schema and migrations
  - tests/
  - Dockerfile + docker-compose.yml
  - README.md
- Include sample .env.example
QUALITY GATES (must pass)
- npm test passes
- npm run lint passes
- npm run build succeeds
- Running locally: docker compose up starts API and the service is usable
WORK STYLE
- Explain your approach briefly first (architecture + folder layout)
